2. The application for provisional arrest shall be in writing and contain :
(a)
a description of the person sought, including information concerning the person's nationality;
(b)
the location of the person sought, if known;
(c)
a brief statement of the facts of the case, including, if possible, the time and place of the commission of the offence;
(d)
a description of the laws violated;
(e)
a statement of the existence of a warrant of arrest, or judgment of conviction against the person sought; and
(f)
a statement that a request for extradition of the person sought will follow.
